{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50136","headline":"暮秋书怀 · 崔湜","name":"暮秋书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"首夏别京辅，杪秋滞三河。\n沉沉蓬莱阁，日夕乡思多。\n霜剪凉墀蕙，风捎幽渚荷。\n岁芳坐沦歇，感此至微歌。\n（〖1〗按这一首，《全唐诗》卷三一作爲魏徵的诗，而《珠英集》作崔湜；《珠英集》应可据，故仍补入崔湜名下。\n第七句「沦歌」有误，依《全唐诗》应作歇。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}